ェス」開催まで刻一刻と迫るなか、ルイの提案をもとに、ピタドルメンバーは史上最大の賭けに出ることを決意する!!","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-03-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/taNuQjRnTyd9UpQFXMz5T3XeQzL.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/taNuQjRnTyd9UpQFXMz5T3XeQzL.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69294/season/1/episode/12"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69294/season/1"},"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793647979650,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"2":{"checkedAt":1793647979650,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"3":{"checkedAt":1793647979650,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"4":{"checkedAt":1793647979650,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"5":{"checkedAt":1793647979650,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"6":{"checkedAt":1793647979650,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"7":{"checkedAt":1793647979650,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"8":{"checkedAt":1793647979650,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"9":{"checkedAt":1793647979650,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"10":{"checkedAt":1793647979650,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"11":{"checkedAt":1793647979650,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"12":{"checkedAt":1793647979650,"status":"ok","retryCount":0}}}
